  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Fomento al Turismo</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tourism Development Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El fin del programa es fortalecer el sector turstico y su posicionamiento nacional e internacional, contribuyendo as a una mejor distribucin de la renta y a la obtencin de un flujo creciente y sostenible de divisas tursticas.El propsito del programa es generar un marco integral de competitividad y sostenibilidad turstica.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The goal of the program is to strengthen the tourism sector and its national and international positioning, contributing this way to a better income distribution and to the obtaining of an increasing and sustainable flow of tourism currencies. The purpose of the program is to generate an integral frame of competitiveness and tourism sustainability.</narrative>
  </description>
